## ScholarPay Backend

[![ALATPay](https://img.shields.io/badge/ALATPay-Integrated-00A859?style=for-the-badge)](https://alatpay.ng)
[![Node.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-22+-339933?style=for-the-badge&logo=node.js&logoColor=white)](https://nodejs.org)
[![Express](https://img.shields.io/badge/Express-5-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=express&logoColor=white)](https://expressjs.com)
[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-5+-3178C6?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org)
[![Prisma](https://img.shields.io/badge/Prisma-ORM-2D3748?style=for-the-badge&logo=prisma&logoColor=white)](https://www.prisma.io)
[![PostgreSQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/PostgreSQL-Database-4169E1?style=for-the-badge&logo=postgresql&logoColor=white)](https://www.postgresql.org)
[![Swagger](https://img.shields.io/badge/Swagger-OpenAPI-85EA2D?style=for-the-badge&logo=swagger&logoColor=black)](https://swagger.io)

ScholarPay is a school fee collection and installment management platform designed to simplify how schools collect tuition and other educational fees while improving transparency for parents.

The platform enables schools to create structured fee records and flexible installment plans, then automates the entire payment lifecycle—from scheduling payment reminders and generating secure virtual accounts to verifying payments and notifying parents in real time. This eliminates the need for manual follow-ups, reduces administrative overhead, and gives schools complete visibility into payment progress.

Built with a modern backend architecture using Node.js, Express, TypeScript, Prisma, and PostgreSQL, ScholarPay integrates with ALATPay for virtual account generation and payment verification, and leverages WhatsApp notifications to keep parents informed throughout the payment journey.

## Why ScholarPay

Schools need predictable cash flow, while parents need flexible and transparent payment options. ScholarPay solves both sides of that challenge in one workflow.

- Reduces payment friction with installment-based collections instead of one-off lump-sum demands.
- Improves collection success by automating reminders and payment verification.
- Lowers admin workload by removing manual reconciliation and repetitive parent follow-ups.
- Increases trust through clear parent notifications and real-time payment visibility.
- Supports operational scale with standardized APIs, pagination, and background automation.

## What This Backend Does

- Allows schools to register, authenticate, and manage students.
- Lets schools create fee records with automatic installment generation.
- Automatically generates virtual accounts close to installment due dates.
- Verifies pending ALATPay transactions on a schedule.
- Updates payment, installment, and fee record statuses automatically.
- Sends payment instructions, confirmations, and reminders via WhatsApp Cloud API.
- Exposes paginated API endpoints with a consistent collection response format.

## Current Payment Lifecycle

1. School creates fee record.
2. Installments are generated automatically.
3. Background instruction job checks due/near-due installments and generates virtual accounts.
4. Parent receives payment instructions on WhatsApp.
5. Parent transfers to the virtual account.
6. Background verification job checks pending ALATPay transactions.
7. Payment is marked successful, installment updated, fee record recalculated, confirmation sent.

## Tech Stack

- Runtime: Node.js
- API: Express 5
- Language: TypeScript
- ORM: Prisma
- Database: PostgreSQL
- Payment Provider: ALATPay Bank Transfer API
- Messaging: WhatsApp Cloud API
- Docs: Swagger (OpenAPI)

